      "content": "I hear the weight of your loss and the exhaustion behind the words, and I want you to know that your identity is not truly gone, only hidden beneath the weight of what you've lost. You are not a hollow shell but a living person who has survived a great tragedy and is now ready to find a new way to be. It is never too late to rebuild a sense of self that feels real and true, and I am here to help you find that path.",
